Get started Download What it is Gallery Printable FAQ GitHub Create an account
Client proofing for photographers, from your own device
Share a shoot with your client as a gallery link. They open it on any phone or computer, give stars to the photos they like and leave a note wherever they'd like a change. You get an alert, open the collection and see their picks, best first. The photos stay on your own Off The Cloud device, and the link expires by itself.
@a.href=/#install
@a.href=#how
Get started How it works
